WEBVTT

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.639
AG: I've been doing the majority
of my work remotely

00:13:33.663 --> 00:13:35.026
for the past 15 years.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:37.193
Some of the key members
of our "WorkLife" team

00:13:37.217 --> 00:13:38.866
have never even met face-to-face,

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:40.414
so reaching shared understanding

00:13:40.438 --> 00:13:42.471
has been key in our collaborations.

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:45.741
If you work with me, we have
a shared understanding

00:13:45.765 --> 00:13:48.476
that my biggest vice is
being chronically late.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:51.496
I have a hard time disengaging
from a task before it's done,

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:54.346
and I try to squeeze
too much into each day,

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.990
but I often have calls with people

00:13:56.014 --> 00:13:58.226
who don't have that context.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.096
Eventually, I had to start
managing expectations.